@DO
.
=DO
.
.DO ... LOOP, with a WHILE or UNTIL test at the top, at the bottom, at both
.or at neither. With no test the loop runs until EXIT DO.
.
:DIM N AS UWORD
:DO WHILE N < 10
:  N = N + 1
:LOOP
:DO
:  N = N - 1
:LOOP UNTIL N = 0
.
.A test at the top is compiled at the bottom, so it costs no more per pass.
